{"id":"4d5e52f1-86bc-4cc9-9003-7cae448fda1e","object":"chat.completion","created":1784982929,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    core = case['core_distance']\\n    distances = case['distances']\\n    n = len(nodes)\\n    if n == 0:\\n        return {'mst_edges': [], 'total_weight': 0.0}\\n    # Build edge list: (mutual_reach, u, v)\\n    edges = []\\n    for u, v, d in distances:\\n        mr = max(core[u], core[v], d)\\n        if u > v:\\n            u, v = v, u\\n        edges.append((mr, u, v))\\n    # Sort: primary by mutual_reach, secondary by node ids (already tuple order works)\\n    edges.sort()\\n    # Union-Find\\n    parent = {node: node for node in nodes}\\n    rank = {node: 0 for node in nodes}\\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n    def union(x, y):\\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\\n        if rx == ry:\\n            return False\\n        if rank[rx] < rank[ry]:\\n            parent[rx] = ry\\n        elif rank[rx] > rank[ry]:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n        else:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n            rank[rx] += 1\\n        return True\\n    mst_edges = []\\n    total_weight = 0.0\\n    for mr, u, v in edges:\\n        if len(mst_edges) == n - 1:\\n            break\\n        if union(u, v):\\n            mst_edges.append([u, v, mr])\\n            total_weight += mr\\n    if len(mst_edges) != n - 1 and n > 1:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"Disconnected graph: cannot form MST\\\")\\n    return {'mst_edges': mst_edges, 'total_weight': total_weight}\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to produce Python source code for solve(case) that implements the described algorithm: compute core distances (already given as core_distance dict per node), then for each pair (u,v) compute mutual reachability = max(core_dist[u], core_dist[v], distance). Then run Kruskal to find MST. The output must be {\"mst_edges\": list of [node1, node2, weight], \"total_weight\": sum of weights}. The edges should be sorted by reachability then endpoint IDs. The edges are undirected, so we should canonicalize each pair (e.g., store nodes in sorted order). Use deterministic union-find.\n\nConstraints: use only Python standard library, no mutation of input, no randomness, no external dependencies.\n\nImplementation steps:\n1. validate input: case has 'nodes', 'core_distance', 'distances' keys. Ensure 'nodes' is list, 'core_distance' dict mapping node to float, 'distances' list of [node1, node2, dist].\n2. Build list of edges: for each distance entry, get u,v,d. Compute mutual_reach = max(core_distance[u], core_distance[v], d). Canonicalize: if u>v swap so u<v. Append (mutual_reach, u, v). Ensure we handle missing nodes? Assume all nodes in distances are in nodes list and core_distance.\n3. Sort edges by (mutual_reach, u, v).\n4. Union-Find: use dict parent, rank. Define find with path compression.\n5. Iterate sorted edges, if find(u) != find(v), union, add edge [u, v, mutual_reach] to mst_edges, accumulate weight.\n6. Stop when mst_edges length == len(nodes)-1. If not enough edges, raise ValueError.\n7. Return {\"mst_edges\": mst_edges, \"total_weight\": total_weight}.\n\nEdge cases: empty nodes? Probably at least 1 node? MST requires at least 1? If nodes==1, MST has no edges, total_weight=0. But ensure distances list may be empty? Should handle gracefully. But given fixtures, nodes count is 5.\n\nWrite code as string.\n\nMake sure to output exactly the JSON object with \"implementation\" key.\n\nNote: The required output structure has mst_edges as array of arrays each with 3 elements: string, string, number. Our implementation will produce that.\n\nWe must not use any external libraries.\n\nNow write the Python code."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2046,"completion_tokens":1010,"total_tokens":3056,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":526},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":0,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":2046},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}